OL,3,GNEWSA'Adrenaline got us through New
OL,4,AForest wildfire'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was almost apocalyptic," recalls
OL,7,Fretained firefighter Matt O'Hare, as he
OL,8,Fdescribes the scene that greeted him at
OL,9,Fthe devastating wildfire in the New
OL,10,FForest.
OL,12,FFire spread from a blazing van on the
OL,13,FA31 on 9 August, destroying ancient oak
OL,14,Fand beech trees, rare heathland and
OL,15,Fwildlife across an area of more than
OL,16,F100 hectares.
OL,18,FO'Hare, 27, was sent with crewmates
OL,19,Ffrom Fordingbridge Fire Station.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
