OL,3,GNEWSA'Adrenaline got us through New
OL,4,AForest wildfire'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As we went through the New Forest, we
OL,7,Fcould see the huge smoke plume and we
OL,8,Fthought, 'This is big'," he said.
